							<li><a class="portal-row" href="/tutorials/codex-cli-windows/"><span class="portal-title">초보자 Codex CLI 설치 · 단계별 실습</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></li>
							<li><a class="portal-row" href="/academy/agent-orchestration-20261108/"><span class="portal-title">오늘의 미니 아카데미 · CLI / Agent / Orchestration</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></li>
							<li><a class="portal-row" href={ACADEMY_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="portal-title">Doctor AI Academy 열기</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></li>
						</ul>
					</div>
					<div class="portal-group">
						<h3>{copy.crmGroup}</h3>
						<ul class="portal-rows">
							<li><a class="portal-row" href="/tutorials/crm-scenarios/"><span class="portal-title">{copy.crmGroup}</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></li>
							<li><a class="portal-row" href="/tutorials/crm-scenarios/pain-points/"><span class="portal-title">{copy.crmGuide}</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></li>
						</ul>
